Carbon Design System
Copyright 2015 IBM Corp.
https://github.com/carbon-design-system/carbon
Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Cinder's generated tokens derive from the official @carbon/themes,
@carbon/layout, @carbon/type, and @carbon/motion packages. Cinder changes the
CSS namespace, serializes the values as CSS/JSON, and adds contextual layer
aliases and typography/control conveniences. Component CSS is Cinder's
implementation of the referenced Carbon visual rules. The generated source
files identify these modifications. Carbon's original attribution is retained.

